<title>POLAND: SANOK MARCH NET RISES TO PLN 1.7 MLN.</title>
<headline>SANOK MARCH NET RISES TO PLN 1.7 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results March </p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>MARCH</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.69 vs   1.57</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 3.02 vs   1.57</p>
<p> Operating profit     2.94 vs   1.63</p>
<p> Sales		   14.14 vs  12.28</p>
<p>JANUARY-MARCH</p>
<p> Net profit	     5.04 vs   2.62</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 7.00 vs   2.62</p>
<p> Operating profit     6.34 vs   2.71</p>
<p> Sales		   38.61 vs  32.67</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish rubber firm is Stomil Sanok SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
